WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.180
Also call for any of these:

2
00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:07.660
a fever above 101.5 degrees Fahrenheit;

3
00:00:07.784 --> 00:00:11.020
swelling, or fluid building up, behind your ear;

4
